  "notes": "{対|たい}する is a suru-verb meaning to face, confront, or be directed toward something.\n\nKEY PATTERNS:\n- 〜に{対|たい}する + noun: ~ regarding/toward ~ (prenominal)\n- 〜に{対|たい}して: toward ~, in response to ~ (adverbial)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {問題|もんだい}に{対|たい}する: regarding a problem\n- {質問|しつもん}に{対|たい}する{回答|かいとう}: answer to a question\n- 〜に{対|たい}する{態度|たいど}: attitude toward ~\n- 〜に{対|たい}する{関心|かんしん}: interest in ~\n\nUSAGE:\n- Formal and written style\n- Common in business, academic, and news contexts\n- Often implies a relationship between two things\n\nCONTRAST:\nThe casual equivalent is often simply に or について.",
